            <div xml:id="d334">

                <pb facs="0451" n="345" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg345"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Translation of telegrams from minister for foreign relations of Chile to Chilean minister, delivered to Mr. Blaine
                        by Señor Montt, January 15</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-01-14"><hi rendition="#italic">January 14,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Minister <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montt</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>English Fireman Shields, of American merchant vessel <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Keweenaw</hi>, was declared deserter by captain of vessel 24th October
                    last. Same day police took him up drunk in street.</p>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">January</hi> 11. Davidson accused of stoning.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
